      and optional horizontal row bands of the majority base color.
    column_bands: 3-4 bands alternating MIN/MAJ starting with MIN; widths 2-10
    row_bands: 1-5 bands alternating MIXED/UNIFORM-MAJ starting and ending with MIXED; heights 2-15
    result: MIN blocks appear only at MIXED-row x MIN-col intersections; all else is MAJ
    majority_area: 56-59% of grid [observed]
